          "body": "<p>Closing the reviewed implementation as Done for traceability. Its target logic is superseded by the current Deal identity model: WAGR-448 reserves the raw makeup key through all non-Retired states and releases it only on Retired; WAGR-450 owns activation; WAGR-453 owns First-Activated identity locking. The old &#039;External Deal ID never moves on pre-activation makeup edit&#039; / suffix assumptions are no longer the target design.</p>",
